  "body_html": "<h1>Myerson Payment Formula</h1>\n<p>For single-parameter mechanisms over real values, the Myerson module defines\nthe canonical payment formula associated to an allocation rule and records the\nzero-normalized payment condition.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 9, Section 9.5.4, Thm. 9.36] Nisan, Roughgarden, Tardos,\n  and Vazirani, <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>. Payment formulae for monotone\n  single-parameter allocation rules.</li>\n<li>[Myerson 1981, Section 2] Myerson, R. B. \"Optimal auction design.\"\n  <em>Mathematics of Operations Research</em> 6(1):58-73. Canonical\n  single-parameter payment identities in auction-design notation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Provenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrated from EconCSLib pull request 27, old blueprint label\n  <code>def:md_myerson_payment_interface</code> in <code>blueprint/src/content.tex</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
